<title>HONG KONG: Colliers Jardine names senior management.</title>
<headline>Colliers Jardine names senior management.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colliers Jardine, the real estate arm of Jardine Pacific, said on Monday that David Govey had been appointed managing director of Colliers Jardine Australia and New Zealand.</p>
<p>Govey replaces Bruce Cotterill, who will leave at the end of the year, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Peter Collins will succeed Govey as managing director of Singapore and regional managing director of Southeast Asia.</p>
<p>The replacement for Collins, managing director of Colliers Jardine Indonesia, would be named in the near future, it said.</p>
<p>Colliers Jardine has 34 offices in 12 Asia-Pacific countries.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
